import json, re
STYLE="Match the exact art style of the attached image. Warm cozy Korean storybook illustration style blending vintage picture-book illustration with modern 2D feature-animation design. Thin consistent slightly hand-drawn dark-brown outlines, flat color fills with very subtle soft two-tone shading, visible fine paper grain texture over all colors, clean simple shapes, no gradients, no glossy highlights, details drawn with fine lines in a slightly darker tone."
FACE="Simple delicate faces: small round dark eyes with a tiny white highlight, thin short eyebrows, tiny line nose, small mouth, soft round peach blush."
AV="Avoid photorealism, 3D rendering, anime-style big eyes, glossy webtoon shading, painterly brushstrokes, watercolor bleeding, gradients, heavy shadows, text, letters, signs with writing, watermarks."

SS="""Use the FIRST attached image (the pastel shop-front illustration) as the strict art-style reference. If character sheets are also attached, use them ONLY for the characters' faces, hairstyles and outfits, and redraw those characters in the flat style of the first image.

ART STYLE (STRICT): A charming flat 2D animated illustration with Wes Anderson–inspired art direction. Hand-drawn 2D animation aesthetic, clean thin dark-brown outlines of consistent weight, simplified geometric shapes, large flat solid color fills, minimal two-tone cel shading, crisp edges, very little detail, elegantly stylized proportions. Simple faces: small dark eyes, thin eyebrows, tiny line nose, small mouth, soft pink cheeks. Snowflakes are simple small round white dots. Lamp and window light are simple flat pale shapes, never glowing.

COMPOSITION: Meticulously balanced, near-symmetrical, centered subjects, straight-on frontal camera angle, eye-level, carefully aligned architecture, theatrical staging, a few objects in an orderly arrangement."""
SAV="AVOID: Photorealism, 3D rendering, painterly brushstrokes, watercolor, paper grain, film grain, noise texture, cross-hatching, sketchy lines, fine texture detail, fabric or fur texture, rendered snow, glossy modern webtoon, anime-style big eyes, volumetric lighting, glow, bloom, depth of field, gradients, complex shadows, dramatic perspective, excessive detail, cluttered background, text, letters, signs with writing, watermarks."
DAY="COLOR PALETTE: Muted dusty pink, powder blue, pale mint, butter yellow, warm cream, faded coral, soft terracotta and muted burgundy accents. Limited harmonious pastel color blocking.\n\nLIGHTING: Soft, even, diffuse light, minimal shadows, tonal separation with flat color shapes only."
NIGHT="COLOR PALETTE: Muted dusty navy and powder-blue night colors with warm butter-yellow, faded coral and soft terracotta accents for lamps and lit windows. Limited harmonious color blocking.\n\nLIGHTING: Soft, even, flat night lighting, minimal shadows, warm light shown only as flat pale-yellow shapes."
def scene(body,pal,mood,fmt): return f"{SS}\n\n{body}\n\n{pal}\n\nMOOD: {mood}\n\n{fmt}\n\n{SAV}"

CG_FMT="FORMAT: Vertical 2:3 portrait illustration (1024x1536), one full-bleed scene, no border, no panels, no text. FRAMING: Choose the framing that suits the scene: a close-up from the waist or mid-thigh up is fine, and so is a full body shot. If the frame edge crosses a character, it must cross at the waist or mid-thigh, never at the knees, shins, ankles or feet. The whole picture is shown in the game without cropping."
BG_FMT="FORMAT: Vertical 2:3 portrait background (1024x1536), full-bleed, no border, no text. Empty scene with NO people. Leave the lower third fairly simple because dialogue boxes cover it."
